  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-32\">\n  <header class=\"article-header\">\n    <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 32</h2>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"article-content\">\n    <section class=\"paragraph\" id=\"para-1er\">\n      <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 1er.</h3>\n      <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n        <p class=\"intro-text\">Les grades des volontaires se succèdent dans l'ordre hiérarchique suivant :</p>\n        <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">soldat ou matelot;</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">premier soldat ou premier matelot;</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">caporal ou quartier-maître;</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"4°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\"><span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"1\" data-dossier-number=\"2013-07-31/04\" data-law-type=\"L\" data-article-number=\"45\">...</span></span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"5°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">caporal-chef ou quartier-maître-chef;</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"6°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">premier caporal-chef ou premier quartier-maître-chef;</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"7°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\"><span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"1\" data-dossier-number=\"2013-07-31/04\" data-law-type=\"L\" data-article-number=\"45\">...</span></span>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n        <p>On distingue les sous-catégories de volontaires suivantes :</p>\n        <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">les titulaires des grades visés à l'alinéa 1er, 1° à 3°, sont appelés volontaires subalternes;</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"2°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\">les titulaires des grades visés à l'alinéa 1er, <span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"1\" data-dossier-number=\"2013-07-31/04\" data-law-type=\"L\" data-article-number=\"45\">5° et 6°</span>, sont appelés volontaires d'élite;</span>\n          </li>\n          <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"3°\">\n            <span class=\"provision-text\"><span class=\"footnote footnote-reference\" data-footnote-id=\"1\" data-dossier-number=\"2013-07-31/04\" data-law-type=\"L\" data-article-number=\"45\">]...</span></span>\n          </li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"paragraph\" id=\"para-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"paragraph-marker\">§ 2.</h3>\n      <div class=\"paragraph-content\">\n        <p>L'appellation du grade peut être complétée par l'un des vocables que le Roi détermine.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n</article>",
